// THE COMPANY BRAIN — one company number -> a full 360 assembled across 4 live APIs.
//
//   Companies House (identity + postcode)
//        -> Postcodes.io (postcode -> coordinates + geography)
//             -> Police.uk        (street crime near the registered office)
//             -> Environment Agency (flood stations near the registered office)
//
// Orbital plans the entire graph from one id — no integration is declared anywhere.
// Requires the free Companies House API key configured in Orbital (Phase 2); until
// then, see crime-near-postcode.taxi for the no-auth keystone proof.
//
// 09446231 = Monzo Bank Ltd.
given { id : uk.gov.CompanyRegistrationNumber = "09446231" }
find { uk.gov.demo.Company360 }
